WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Start with your account navigation
Invoices and orders opens purchase history. Returns, wishlist and
reviews are separate account areas, so you can find the task you need.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Keep the invoice number
The invoice identifies your purchase. One invoice may group several
vendor orders; use its number when contacting support.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Read totals and payment separately
Review the amount and currency alongside payment information. A document
being issued is different from payment being confirmed.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Follow each vendor order
The order section shows its own progress. Use cancellation only when
offered and eligible; delivery and returns have their own steps.

